---
description: Test expectations for Physical OS behavior changes
globs: "**/*.{test,spec}.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Tests

- Cover the behavior you changed: capability parsing, policy deny, automation conditions, or the API journey.
- Use a temporary directory for SQLite and delete it. Do not point tests at `./data`.
- Assert `outcome` and `verified`, not only the HTTP status.
- Include one negative case for untrusted input when the change accepts a payload or a sentence.

```ts
expect(result.outcome).toBe('rejected');
expect(result.verified).toBe(false);
```

Do not skip a failing test. Do not claim Playwright coverage; this repository does not run browser end-to-end tests yet.
